ass="landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z-ag_XdAxsiBwC6o_walkies24ccb.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z-ag_XdAxsiBwC6o_walkies2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C374%2C1059%2C706&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z-ag_XdAxsiBwC6o_walkies2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C374%2C1059%2C706&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z-ag_XdAxsiBwC6o_walkies2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C374%2C1059%2C706&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="667" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Meet our robot dog</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You may have seen this on social media – our prototype delivery robot dog! It’s being tested to accompany couriers on their rounds and even deliver parcels simultaneously. This robot can capture photos to provide proof of delivery and support consumers who need more time to get to the door. It’s just one of the ways we’re exploring to make doorstep delivery even smarter.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__button-wrapper" data-v-54256dfc><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link landing-feature-banner__button landing-feature-banner__button--standard" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/press/evri-embarks-on-robot-dog-deliveries" data-v-54256dfc style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Find out more<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></section><section id="putting-customers-first-with-personalised-deliveries" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--neutral" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container--image-right landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdJ5bqstJ9-iny_EVRI_LOCATION_05_82488a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdJ5bqstJ9-iny_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8248.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdJ5bqstJ9-iny_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8248.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdJ5bqstJ9-iny_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8248.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri courier is handing three parcels to a man at his doorstep. They are both laughing as if a funny joke or anecdote was shared." width="1000" height="667" class="landing-feature-banner__image landing-feature-banner__image--image-right" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--image-right landing-feature-banner__content--neutral landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Putting customers first with personalised deliveries</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--neutral" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our innovation doesn’t stop at robotics. We’re exploring how to make your experience even more personal. By combining data such as past reviews, courier ratings and location type, we’ll be able to make deliveries work better for you. In the future, we aim to adapt deliveries to your preferences so we can always get it right.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="smarter-training-with-extended-reality" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thyJbqstJ9-e-N_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6523dd13.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thyJbqstJ9-e-N_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6523.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=811%2C0%2C7381%2C4923&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thyJbqstJ9-e-N_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6523.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=811%2C0%2C7381%2C4923&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thyJbqstJ9-e-N_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6523.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=811%2C0%2C7381%2C4923&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier delivering a parcel to an excited mother and child. The Courier is taking a photo for proof of delivery on their mobile device." width="1000" height="667" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Smarter training with extended reality</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’re also researching extended reality and AI to create training and support tools for our couriers. By using cutting-edge tech, we aim to help them deliver with even greater confidence, care and accuracy.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="creativity-and-innovation-at-evri" class="section-wrapper" index="5" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><div class="section__description" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5okkpbqstJ99_Wf_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-33131c4.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5okkpbqstJ99_Wf_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-331.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C6109%2C4075&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5okkpbqstJ99_Wf_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-331.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C6109%2C4075&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5okkpbqstJ99_Wf_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-331.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C6109%2C4075&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--h-100 card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Creativity and Innovation at Evri</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--