ge_header$70975a50-a886-4e15-b917-3dfd352ce894","page_header",{"variation":33,"version":17,"items":34,"primary":36,"id":79,"slice_type":80,"slice_label":21},"cardWithImageNoCta",[35],{},{"CardImage":37,"CardAvatar":48,"CardTitle":49,"CardText":50,"IsEco":78},{"dimensions":38,"alt":41,"copyright":21,"url":42,"id":43,"edit":44},{"width":39,"height":40},1000,667,"An Evri corporate employee is delivering a presentation in a meeting room. They are stood in front of a large screen displaying some delivery statistics","delivering-innovation.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7Nksp7c43Q3f32K_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-345.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=1%2C0%2C5988%2C3994&w=1000&h=667","Z7Nksp7c43Q3f32K",{"x":45,"y":46,"zoom":45,"background":47},1,0,"transparent","none","How Evri is delivering innovation behind the scenes",[51],{"type":52,"text":53,"spans":54,"direction":77},"paragraph","We're always looking for ways to make parcel delivery simpler, smarter and more sustainable. While you might know us for our ParcelShops, Lockers and couriers, there’s a whole world of innovation happening behind the scenes to improve how we deliver for you – and we're excited to share some of it with you this World Creativity and Innovation Day.",[55,63,65,70,71,76],{"start":56,"end":57,"type":58,"data":59},125,136,"hyperlink",{"link_type":60,"url":61,"target":62},"Web","delivering-innovation.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops","_blank",{"start":56,"end":57,"type":64},"strong",{"start":66,"end":67,"type":58,"data":68},138,145,{"link_type":60,"url":69,"target":62},"delivering-innovation.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"start":66,"end":67,"type":64},{"start":72,"end":73,"type":58,"data":74},150,158,{"link_type":60,"url":75,"target":62},"delivering-innovation.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"start":72,"end":73,"type":64},"ltr",false,"card$55a3b54c-e701-4ea8-89a6-6fbead5dedb0","card",{"variation":82,"version":17,"items":83,"primary":84,"id":104,"slice_type":105,"slice_label":21},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":85,"show_premium_logo":78,"label":21,"label_theme":86,"titleH2":87,"bodyText":88,"image":92,"rightImage":78,"buttonText":99,"buttonLink":100,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"primary_button_external":78,"button_secondary":103,"secondary_button_external":78},"standard","Core","Meet our robot dog",[89],{"type":52,"text":90,"spans":91,"direction":77},"You may have seen this on social media – our prototype delivery robot dog! It’s being tested to accompany couriers on their rounds and even deliver parcels simultaneously. This robot can capture photos to provide proof of delivery and support consumers who need more time to get to the door. It’s just one of the ways we’re exploring to make doorstep delivery even smarter.",[],{"dimensions":93,"alt":21,"copyright":21,"url":94,"id":95,"edit":96},{"width":39,"height":40},"delivering-innovation.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ-ag_XdAxsiBwC6o_walkies2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C374%2C1059%2C706&w=1000&h=667","Z-ag_XdAxsiBwC6o",{"x":46,"y":97,"zoom":98,"background":47},374,1.02,"Find out more",{"link_type":60,"key":101,"url":102},"23050bb8-2d2f-4000-afe8-52c74d62b428","delivering-innovation.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-embarks-on-robot-dog-deliveries",{"link_type":25},"landing_feature_banner$db8f7b85-6839-4d51-a571-83c7f668a739","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":82,"version":17,"items":107,"primary":108,"id":124,"slice_type":105,"slice_label":21},[],{"theme":109,"show_premium_logo":78,"label":21,"label_theme":86,"titleH2":110,"bodyText":111,"image":115,"rightImage":121,"buttonText":21,"buttonLink":122,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"primary_button_external":78,"button_secondary":123,"secondary_button_external":78},"neutral","Putting customers first with personalised deliveries",[112],{"type":52,"text":113,"spans":114,"direction":77},"Our innovation doesn’t stop at robotics. We’re exploring how to make your experience even more personal. By combining data such as past reviews, courier ratings and location type, we’ll be able to make deliveries work better for you. In the future, we aim to adapt deliveries to your preferences so we can always get it right.",[],{"dimensions":116,"alt":117,"copyright":21,"url":118,"id":119,"edit":120},{"width":39,"height":40},"An Evri courier is handing three parcels to a man at his doorstep. They are both laughing as if a funny joke or anecdote was shared.","delivering-innovation.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdJ5bqstJ9-iny_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8248.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdJ5bqstJ9-iny",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":45,"background":47},true,{"link_type":25},{"link_type":25},"landing_feature_banner$341a8b74-8328-44f2-aa6c-020366bfa380",{"variation":82,"version":17,"items":126,"primary":127,"id":143,"slice_type":105,"slice_label":21},[],{"theme":85,"show_premium_logo":78,"label":21,"label_theme":86,"titleH2":128,"bodyText":129,"image":133,"rightImage":78,"buttonText":21,"buttonLink":141,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"primary_button_external":78,"button_secondary":142,"secondary_button_external":78},"Smarter training with extended reality",[130],{"type":52,"text":131,"spans":132,"direction":77},"We’re also researching extended reality and AI to create training and support tools for our couriers. By using cutting-edge tech, we aim to help them deliver with even greater confidence, care and accuracy.",[],{"dimensions":134,"alt":135,"copyright":21,"url":136,"id":137,"edit":138},{"width":39,"height":40},"An Evri Courier delivering a parcel to an excited mother and child. The Courier is taking a photo for proof of delivery on their mobile device.","delivering-innovation.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6thyJbqstJ9-e-N_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6523.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=811%2C0%2C7381%2C4923&w=1000&h=667","Z6thyJbqstJ9-e-N",{"x":139,"y":46,"zoom":140,"background":47},811,1.11,{"link_type":25},{"link_type":25},"landing_feature_banner$e130eb0b-5731-4ac4-987f-412f9f9d1ffb",{"variation":145,"version":17,"items":146,"primary":147,"id":165,"slice_type":80,"slice_label":21},"cardWithinSection",[],{"CardSectionTitle":148,"CardSectionText":149,"CardImage":153,"CardTitle":159,"CardText":160,"ButtonText":21,"ButtonUrl":164,"IsEco":78},"",[150],{"type":52,"text":151,"spans":152,"direction":77}," ",[],{"dimensions":154,"alt":21,"copyright":21,"url":155,"id":156,"edit":157},{"width":39,"height":40},"delivering-innovation.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ5okkpbqstJ99_Wf_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-331.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C6109%2C4075&w=1000&h=667","Z5okkpbqstJ99_Wf",{"x":158,"y":46,"zoom":45,"background":47},2,"Creativity and Innovation at Evri",[161],{"type":52,"text":162,"spans":163,"direction":77},"At Evri, creativity and innovation are part of everything we do, from improving customer experiences to making delivery safer and more sustainable. While not every idea will make it to your doorstep, we’re committed to testing, learning and innovating to bring you the best possible service.",[],{"link_type":25},"card$e76c9576-81a1-4ff7-8ee5-15bb567939fa",{"variation":82,"version":17,"items":167,"primary":168,"id":185,"slice_type":105,"slice_label":21},[],{"theme":85,"show_premium_logo":78,"label":21,"label_theme":86,"titleH2":169,"bodyText":170,"image":174,"rightImage":121,"buttonText":180,"buttonLink":181,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"primary_button_external":78,"button_secondary":184,"secondary_button_external":78},"Interested in joining us?",[171],{"type":52,"text":172,"spans":173,"direction":77},"If you're excited by innovation and want to be part of a team shaping the future of delivery, keep an eye on our new careers section. We’ll share vacancies and opportunities as they become available, from tech and engineering to operations and more.",[],{"dimensions":175,"alt":176,"copyright":21